SECTION 6 — RETENTION (spec section 15, "Retention")
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Configured in SystemSettings, not in code:

  backup.retentionCount       7
  backup.offHostVolumeLabel   MERCHBACKUP
  backup.directory            C:\MerchandisingBackups

Proven by integration test Backup_PrunesOldestDumpsBeyondRetentionCount:
three runs at a retention count of 2 leave exactly two dumps.

A retention count below 1 is treated as "prune nothing" rather than "delete
everything". A misconfigured settings row must not be able to destroy the
backups — spec section 15 asks for a configurable count, not a configurable
self-destruct.


